I already read this file for my last answer, so my recommendation stands. It's the same upload, unchanged: the 8-page preview with the BSI cover, the draft's cover, the contents and the foreword. It doesn't include any of the clause text.

If you can get the full draft from BSI's portal, upload it and I'll check the parts the preview doesn't show:
- the conformance rules: clause 4, the new clause 6 and Annex C;
- which documents are required and whether they can be combined (sections 8.1–8.2);
- the AI section (5.6.6).
